WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:18.000
[Republic City Philharmonic brass fanfare plays]

00:19.000 --> 00:54.000
Shiro Shinobi: Good evening, listeners. Tonight we venture south to the sparkling domes of Zaofu.

00:55.000 --> 01:45.000
Suyin Beifong: When we laid the foundations, the critics claimed metal was too rigid for living.